    "Usage history stores timestamps, token totals, and internal route and endpoint identifiers. Prompts, responses, model names, headers, and API keys are not stored. Streaming requests appear only when the upstream sends usage data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
